C CROWD: USED IF CITY IS SURROUNDED BY ARMIES
C D: ORIGINAL MAP, ENCODED IN MOD 3
C EXPLOR: THIS IS SET TO 1 IF THE ENEMY SHIP IS TO EXPLORE UNKNOWN
