C JECTOR: SECTOR PROGRAM IS LOOKING AT
C KURSOR: SET TO POSITION OF CURSOR
C MODE: 1=IN MODE 2, 0=IN MODE 1
C OWNER: WHO OWNS THE CITY: 0>NOBODY, 1>PLAYER, 2>COMPUTER
